what is ClusterIp
pod is a short lived object
when pod is damaged/crashed k8s will replaced that with new POD
for every pod new ip will be assigned

## it is not at all recommended to use POD ip to access it
Cluster Ip service is used to group all the pods and assign one static ip to access the pods

## using ClusterIp we can access pods only with in the cluster

## Database pods we dont expose for outside access.


what is NodePort service
-----------------------
nodePort service is used to expode the pods to access outside of the cluster

using Nodeport we can access the pods which are running in particular workernode

what is load balancer
---------------------
LB service is used to distribute the load at worker node level

service.yaml

---
apiVersion: v1
kind: service
metadata:
  name: javasvc
spec:
  type: NodePort
  selector:
  app: javapod
ports:
  - port: 80
    targetPort: 8080
    nodePort: 30070

kubectl apply -f service.yaml
    
kubectl get svc
```
When we use service type as NodePort then k8s will use one random port number to expose out application on worker node.

NodePort Range : 30,000 to 32767
if we can also fix nodeport number in service manifest yaml

